.TH "jags\-version" "1" "" "Version 1.0.0" "JAGS Utilities User Manuals"
.SH NAME
jags\-version \- switch the active build/version of JAGS
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]jags\-version\f[R] [\f[I]\-h\f[R]] [\f[I]\-l\f[R]] BUILD
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[B]jags\-version\f[R] is a command\-line utility that can be used to
switch between active versions/builds of JAGS
(https://mcmc\-jags.sourceforge.io) created by the official JAGS
installers for macOS
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-h\f[R]
Display a help message and exit.
.TP
\f[B]\-l\f[R]
List the available builds of JAGS (any BUILD argument is ignored).
.TP
\f[B]BUILD\f[R]
Switch to the build/version of JAGS matching this string.
.SH SEE ALSO
http://mcmc\-jags.sourceforge.net and
https://github.com/mdenwood/JAGS\-build\-macOS
